  {
    "id": 1003001020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ただいま、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "003",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "se": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": -200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 700
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020070",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おかえり、めぐる\r\n聞きたかったことは聞けたか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　知らないこといろいろ教えてもらっちゃった！\r\nえへへ、いい人たちばっかりだったなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか。それは良かったな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さて、そろそろ本番だけど、\r\nそっちの準備は大丈夫か？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "う、うん。緊張とかはしてないし\r\n大丈夫だと思うんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\n何か気になることでも？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あはは……こんなこと言うと\r\n不真面目だーって怒られるかもしれないんだけどね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "心構え、って言うのかな？\r\nどういう気持ちでお仕事をすればいいのかわかんなくて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねえ、プロデューサー\r\nステージに立ったらどんなことを考えればいいかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "select": "まわりのみんなを\r\n支えるつもりでいこう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "select": "とにかく気合いだ！",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "アイドルを\r\n楽しんでこい！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "友達を助けるのと同じだよ\r\n一緒に仕事をする人の手伝いをするつもりで頑張るんだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっかぁ、友達にするのとおんなじでいいんだ？\r\nうん！　それならできそう！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あっ、もう本番がはじまるみたい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ありがとうプロデューサー\r\nじゃあ、行ってくるね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020150"
