  {
    "id": 1003001020220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ただいま、プロデューサー！\r\nどうだった？　わたしの踊り、気合い入ってたかな？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ。他のダンサーにも負けない、\r\n迫力あるダンスだったよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ、頑張った甲斐があったよ～！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、\r\nステージの上ってすごいんだね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "部活とも全然違うドキドキがあって……\r\nなんだかすっごくワクワクしたんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたし、もっといろんなアイドルのお仕事が\r\nしたくなってきちゃった！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この調子で、次の仕事でもめぐるを引っ張っていこう）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
