  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "い、いいの？\r\nお仕事なのに、そんな気持ちで……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん。自分が楽しんでないのに、\r\n他の人を楽しませることなんて、できないからな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか……そうなんだね！！\r\nわたしがみんなに「楽しい」を伝えなきゃなんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300102/1003001020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001020300,
